    // ── شاشة المساعدة ──
    "hp_q1": "Why the A / B / C closeness levels?",
    "hp_a1": "Sawa sorts your relatives by kinship — A for the closest (parents, siblings), B for the middle (uncles, aunts), C for the more distant. Each level has its own reminder interval.",
    "hp_q2": "What is the contact streak?",
    "hp_a2": "Every time you reach a relative on time the streak goes up by one. Miss it and the streak breaks. It's there to keep you going.",
    "hp_q3": "How is kinship worked out automatically?",
    "hp_a3": "Once the tree is linked (father, brother, uncle…) Sawa works out each person's kinship to you from the path between you.",
    "hp_q4": "How do suggestions work?",
    "hp_a4": "Sawa watches who you're overdue with, based on their closeness, and who has an occasion coming up, then suggests you get in touch.",
    "hp_q5": "What is the family memory?",
    "hp_a5": "After each contact Sawa asks what you took away from it. The answer is kept in that relative's file. Over time a family memory builds up.",
    "hp_q6": "How do I add a relative?",
    "hp_a6": "From the Silat Rehim tab → pick the group → “Add relative”, or “Quick add (lineage)” for a whole chain at once.",
    "hp_q7": "What do A***, A** and A* mean?",
    "hp_a7": "All are level A (the closest) but ranked more finely: A*** for parents and spouse, A** for siblings and grandparents, A* for uncles and aunts. Each has its own reminder interval.",
    "hp_q8": "How do I add a lineage quickly?",
    "hp_a8": "Type: “Osama bin Ibrahim bin Mohammed” — Sawa builds the chain for you. A compound name like “Sit El-Nafar” stays one person.",
    "hp_q9": "What's the difference between the tree and the list?",
    "hp_a9": "The list shows every relative in order. The tree shows the family links visually, generation above generation.",
    "hp_q10": "Is my data private?",
    "hp_a10": "Yes — at this stage everything is stored on your device only. There's no server yet and nothing is shared with anyone.",
    "hp_q11": "How do I replay the intro tour?",
    "hp_a11": "Tap “Start the tour” below — the hints will appear again on every screen.",
